  "slug": "教學與課程",
  "title": "教學與課程",
  "summary": "結合本地工藝師，開班授課的方式傳承傳統技藝，例如：竹編、木藝、花藝、茶席等課程，團隊擔任課程宣傳及推廣工作，以擴大地方學習並強化地方工藝之傳承。",
  "cover": "uploads/2026/10/wp-c62b87f29fecf9d98832.jpg",
  "body": "\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-c62b87f29fecf9d98832.jpg\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-1912fbc47635e8f22fb9.jpg\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-1eb4d8d6655af06b716b.jpg\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-c19f4bdb5799c6265e49.jpg\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-e688a18805524ac28127.jpg\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-dfb2cc729e2b4b3f0518.jpg\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-8d81d96d13f3d4db9e78.jpg\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-4ed0971b978e45ca3bcc.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p>結合本地工藝師，開班授課的方式傳承傳統技藝，例如：竹編、木藝、花藝、茶席等課程，團隊擔任課程宣傳及推廣工作，以擴大地方學習並強化地方工藝之傳承。</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
