 {
  "slug": "商品展售",
  "title": "商品展售",
  "summary": "蕃社原創 文創商品展售 老屋建築有需多文化元素，例如：花磚、紅磚牆、屋瓦、斗拱…..等。我們運用這些元素，延續老屋美學工藝，設計出文化產品。 蕃社好市集 線上商城 「蕃社好市集」嚴選在地優良農產及店家",
  "cover": "uploads/2026/10/wp-835ed8a34c43b5a0d719.jpg",
  "body": "\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h4>蕃社原創 <strong>文創商品展售</strong></h4>\n\n\n\n<p>老屋建築有需多文化元素，例如：花磚、紅磚牆、屋瓦、斗拱…..等。我們運用這些元素，延續老屋美學工藝，設計出文化產品。</p>\n\n\n\n<h4><a href=\"https://www.huansiaeshop.com/\">蕃社好市集 線上商城</a></h4>\n\n\n\n<p>「蕃社好市集」嚴選在地優良農產及店家商品，以「蕃社30陳家古厝」為銷售據點，透過網路行銷宣傳商品，提供本地居民最貼近在地的優質選物據點。</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-835ed8a34c43b5a0d719.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-51f2d055f6f61c654b39.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-036904813c3125b1c460.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-098a6390e3f3a388887a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-763b3a254a52a56d5946.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-8cb006f90d06f30e3c24.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-482536b98dce3d1ab669.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-0e0f52ac53915ce77736.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-94d00f3085cf8aeae7ae.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-116bc9a85f48e197220e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-50fd83e6be11d5c97d02.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-b5d2528ab1015cf4bc4c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.huansiaeshop.com/\"><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-e5c699e31d067fe62faf.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><figcaption>番社好市集線上商城</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
